TapiocaOptionBroker_unlock.tree
├── when position is not expired
│   └── it should revert with LockNotExpired
└── when position is expired
    ├── it should reset position total USDO
    ├── it should remove all market shares
    ├── it should clear position markets array
    ├── it should update total locked USDO
    └── it should emit ExitPosition event
